TEXT 1016 -160 Left 2 !*\n.param Gfc=-20 ; magnitude at crossover *\n.param PS=-70 ; phase lag at crossover *\n*\n* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fc=1k ; targeted crossover *\n.param PM=70 ; choose phase margin at crossover *\n*\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=12\n.param Ibias=250u\n.param Vref=2.5\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n*\n.param gm=100u ; transconductance in Siemens *\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n.param boost={PM-PS-90}\n.param G={10**(-Gfc/20)}\n.param kf={tan((boost/2+45)*pi/180)}\n.param fp={fc*kf}\n.param fz={fc/kf}\n.param a={sqrt((fc**2/fp**2)+1)}\n.param b={sqrt((fz**2/fc**2)+1)}\n.param R2={(a/b)*(fp*G)*(Rlower+Rupper)/((fp-fz)*Rlower*gm)}\n.param C1={1/(2*pi*R2*fz)}\n.param C2={Rlower*gm*(b/a)/(2*pi*fp*G*(Rlower+Rupper))}\n*
TEXT 592 -152 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k
TEXT 88 752 Left 2 ;The dc labels are the values of the components:\npV --> pF\nnV --> nF\nkV --> kOhms
TEXT -160 -184 Left 2 !.model dota D Rs=1 TT=100n N=100m
TEXT -568 448 Left 2 ;Type 2 compensator - OTA\nWatch for the Cjo of the clamp diode:\nany added capacitance alters the\nfrequency response. \n \nChristophe Basso
